# The build context of images built from the repository root: the IFC reader's
# sandbox image (services/ifc-reader/Dockerfile; ADR 0031) and, since phase 4,
# the viewer spike's conversion sandbox (services/viewer-spike/Dockerfile;
# ADR 0046), which bundles only its converter and plan cutter. An
# allow list: everything is left out, then the lockfile, the workspace manifests
# and the sources the image bundles are let back in. company/, fixtures, owner
# documents, node_modules, .env and the other packages never reach a build.
# The Python extractor's image builds from services/extractor with its own
# .dockerignore.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/ifc-reader/package.json
!packages/ifc-reader/src/
!packages/extraction-contract/package.json
!packages/extraction-contract/src/
!packages/registry/package.json
!packages/registry/src/
!packages/domain/package.json
!packages/domain/src/
!packages/viewer-spike/package.json
!packages/viewer-spike/src/convert/
!packages/viewer-spike/src/plan/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/node_modules
